{
  "$comment": "Brut pre-render config for mermaid-cli (mmdc). Produces light-theme static SVG matching brut.css tokens. Usage: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i diagram.mmd -o diagram.svg --configFile mermaid-config.json --backgroundColor transparent. Pre-rendered SVG is single-theme by nature — pin its .brut-diagram figure to the light ground (background:#FBF6EC) so it stays readable in dark mode.",
